#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:283
msgid "How the picture is scaled to the TV."
msgstr "⟦Höw thé pîçtûré îs sçàléd tö thé TV.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:284
msgid "Bicubic is sharp, Bicubic Hermite a little softer, Linear softer still; Nearest neighbour keeps pixels square."
msgstr "⟦Bîçûbîç îs shàrp, Bîçûbîç Hérmîté à lîttlé söftér, Lîñéàr söftér stîll; Ñéàrést ñéîghböûr kééps pîxéls sqûàré.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:286
msgid "120 Hz output"
msgstr "⟦120 Hz öûtpût~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:286
msgid "For displays that take 120 Hz."
msgstr "⟦För dîsplàÿs thàt tàké 120 Hz.~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:287
msgid "The 119.88 Hz mode, on displays that support it. Games still run at their own speed, and a frame that misses a refresh waits 8 ms for the next instead of 17."
msgstr "⟦Thé 119.88 Hz mödé, öñ dîsplàÿs thàt sûppört ît. Gàmés stîll rûñ àt théîr öwñ spééd, àñd à fràmé thàt mîssés à réfrésh wàîts 8 ms för thé ñéxt îñstéàd öf 17.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:293
msgid "Holds a game to an even frame rate."
msgstr "⟦Hölds à gàmé tö àñ évéñ fràmé ràté.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:294
msgid "Each frame stays on screen for at least two or three refreshes, so a game that cannot hold the display's rate runs at an even one: 60 or 40 fps with 120 Hz output, 30 or 20 without. 60 fps with 120 Hz output suits a game at 4K that sometimes drops under 60; 30 fps at 60 Hz suits one at 8K. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "⟦Éàçh fràmé stàÿs öñ sçrééñ för àt léàst twö ör thréé réfréshés, sö à gàmé thàt çàññöt höld thé dîsplàÿ's ràté rûñs àt àñ évéñ öñé: 60 ör 40 fps wîth 120 Hz öûtpût, 30 ör 20 wîthöût. 60 fps wîth 120 Hz öûtpût sûîts à gàmé àt 4K thàt sömétîmés dröps ûñdér 60; 30 fps àt 60 Hz sûîts öñé àt 8K. Ålsö îñ thé îñ-gàmé méñû.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:299
msgid "Frame rate, CPU and memory in a corner."
msgstr "⟦Fràmé ràté, ÇPÜ àñd mémörÿ îñ à çörñér.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:300
msgid "Frames per second, CPU and memory use in the top left corner, as Cemu shows them. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "⟦Fràmés pér séçöñd, ÇPÜ àñd mémörÿ ûsé îñ thé töp léft çörñér, às Çémû shöws thém. Ålsö îñ thé îñ-gàmé méñû.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:302
msgid "No stutter while new shaders build."
msgstr "⟦Ñö stûttér whîlé ñéw shàdérs bûîld.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:303
msgid "On, a new shader is built while the game carries on, so it does not stutter, but some things may be missing for a moment. Off, the game waits for each one: stutter, but nothing drawn wrong."
msgstr "⟦Öñ, à ñéw shàdér îs bûîlt whîlé thé gàmé çàrrîés öñ, sö ît döés ñöt stûttér, bût sömé thîñgs màÿ bé mîssîñg för à möméñt. Öff, thé gàmé wàîts för éàçh öñé: stûttér, bût ñöthîñg dràwñ wröñg.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:309
msgid "Higher is sharper and asks more of the GPU."
msgstr "⟦Hîghér îs shàrpér àñd àsks möré öf thé GPÜ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:310
msgid "How large the 3DS's 3D scenes are drawn before they are scaled to the TV. Higher is sharper and asks more of the GPU, and each time a game reads a picture back the wait grows with it."
msgstr "⟦Höw làrgé thé 3DS's 3D sçéñés àré dràwñ béföré théÿ àré sçàléd tö thé TV. Hîghér îs shàrpér àñd àsks möré öf thé GPÜ, àñd éàçh tîmé à gàmé réàds à pîçtûré bàçk thé wàît gröws wîth ît.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:314
msgid "Smooths textures as they are scaled up."
msgstr "⟦Smööths téxtûrés às théÿ àré sçàléd ûp.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:315
msgid "Smooths the game's textures as they are scaled up; None keeps them as the 3DS draws them. A filter redraws every texture at the internal resolution: at high resolutions it is the costliest setting. If a game stutters, try None first."
msgstr "⟦Smööths thé gàmé's téxtûrés às théÿ àré sçàléd ûp; Ñöñé kééps thém às thé 3DS dràws thém. Å fîltér rédràws évérÿ téxtûré àt thé îñtérñàl résölûtîöñ: àt hîgh résölûtîöñs ît îs thé çöstlîést séttîñg. Îf à gàmé stûttérs, trÿ Ñöñé fîrst.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:318
msgid "Custom textures"
msgstr "⟦Çûstöm téxtûrés~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:318
msgid "Texture packs from azahar/load/textures."
msgstr "⟦Téxtûré pàçks fröm àzàhàr/löàd/téxtûrés.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:319
msgid "Texture packs in /data/ps5cemu/azahar/load/textures/<title ID>, as the desktop Azahar loads them."
msgstr "⟦Téxtûré pàçks îñ /dàtà/ps5çémû/àzàhàr/löàd/téxtûrés/<tîtlé ÎD>, às thé désktöp Åzàhàr löàds thém.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:324
msgid "How the DS's screens are scaled."
msgstr "⟦Höw thé DS's sçrééñs àré sçàléd.~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:325
msgid "How the DS's 256 x 192 screens are scaled to the TV. Sharp keeps every pixel square and even at any size; Smooth blurs them together; Square pixels takes the nearest, uneven where the size is not a whole number. The in-game menu changes it too."
msgstr "⟦Höw thé DS's 256 x 192 sçrééñs àré sçàléd tö thé TV. Shàrp kééps évérÿ pîxél sqûàré àñd évéñ àt àñÿ sîzé; Smööth blûrs thém tögéthér; Sqûàré pîxéls tàkés thé ñéàrést, ûñévéñ whéré thé sîzé îs ñöt à whölé ñûmbér. Thé îñ-gàmé méñû çhàñgés ît töö.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:331
msgid "Recompiler"
msgstr "⟦Réçömpîlér~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:332
msgid "No executable memory: the interpreter runs."
msgstr "⟦Ñö éxéçûtàblé mémörÿ: thé îñtérprétér rûñs.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:333
msgid "Runs the DS's two CPUs on melonDS's recompiler, in the executable memory the PS5 gives (Diagnostics says whether it does), much faster than its interpreter. Off: the interpreter, slower, for a game the recompiler gets wrong. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "⟦Rûñs thé DS's twö ÇPÜs öñ mélöñDS's réçömpîlér, îñ thé éxéçûtàblé mémörÿ thé PS5 gîvés (Dîàgñöstîçs sàÿs whéthér ît döés), mûçh fàstér thàñ îts îñtérprétér. Öff: thé îñtérprétér, slöwér, för à gàmé thé réçömpîlér géts wröñg. Åpplîés tö thé ñéxt gàmé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:340
msgid "Screen layout"
msgstr "⟦Sçrééñ làÿöût~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:340
msgid "How the two screens share the TV."
msgstr "⟦Höw thé twö sçrééñs shàré thé TV.~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:341
msgid "One above the other, the top one alone, the top one large with the bottom one beside it, or the two side by side. In a game, touchpad click + R1 goes to the next."
msgstr "⟦Öñé àbövé thé öthér, thé töp öñé àlöñé, thé töp öñé làrgé wîth thé böttöm öñé bésîdé ît, ör thé twö sîdé bÿ sîdé. Îñ à gàmé, töûçhpàd çlîçk + R1 göés tö thé ñéxt.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:344
msgid "Artwork around the screens."
msgstr "⟦Årtwörk àröûñd thé sçrééñs.~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:345
msgid "Artwork around the screens, never over them. It follows every layout, and the in-game menu changes it too."
msgstr "⟦Årtwörk àröûñd thé sçrééñs, ñévér övér thém. Ît föllöws évérÿ làÿöût, àñd thé îñ-gàmé méñû çhàñgés ît töö.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:351
msgid "Wii U games' volume"
msgstr "⟦Wîî Ü gàmés' völûmé~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:351
